NOTICE for rows*.jsonl (source=jankeesvw-history)

Text sources only (QML, JS, shell, Python, Rust, JSON, TOML, systemd units); no binary, audio or image assets are included (sound/screenshot/preview files are excluded by extension and by UTF-8 decode).

